# Development guidelines — __NAME__

This is a generated dPLaaX auth.provider instance. Refer to the upstream
sources of truth before touching the wiring:

- **dPLaaX auth spec** (3-layer model, L1 boundaries, DID grammar):
  <https://github.com/provin-line/scope/tree/main/scopes/spec.dplaax/.claude/specs>
- **`@o3co/auth-provider-core`** runtime + composition docs:
  <https://github.com/o3co/auth.provider>
- **`@provin-line/auth-provider-dplaax-module`** module wiring + DID resolver:
  <https://github.com/provin-line/auth/tree/main/packages/auth-provider-dplaax-module>

## Where to add things

| Concern | File |
| --- | --- |
| Per-deployment HOCON overrides | `config/{development,production}.conf` |
| OAuth client registry | `config/clients.yaml` |
| Signing-key material | `keys/` (gitignored) |
| Per-deployment custom modules | `src/main.mts` — pass via `buildModules` overrides argument |

## Tests

```bash
__PACKAGE_MANAGER_BIN__ run test
```

Add per-deployment tests under `src/__tests__/`. The default vitest config
discovers `src/**/__tests__/**/*.test.mts`.

## Regenerating

To pick up newer dPLaaX or o3co framework pins, re-run
`@provin-line/create-auth-provider` at the newer release tag and diff the
output against this directory. Hand-edits to deployment payload
(`config/`, `clients.yaml`, `keys/`) survive a regenerate when re-applied;
framework wiring (`src/main.mts`, `package.json` deps, `tsconfig.json`)
is overwritten.
